<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-STENIEL H1 NET LOSS 97.38 MLN PESOS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-STENIEL H1 NET LOSS 97.38 MLN PESOS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales			     1,263 vs 1,260</p>
<p>    Net income			(97.38) vs 17.37</p>
<p>Note: Full name Steniel Manufacturing Corp, the packaging arm of Metro Pacific Corp. Company attributed the losses to its corrugated carton operations in the northern Philippine island of Luzon facing severe competition resulting in a glut.</p>
